WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:09.840
This group of YouTubers went viral for cutting&nbsp;
a Fiat Panda in half that somehow still drives.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.320
According to its creators, driving the near ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.380
level vehicle involves guidance&nbsp;
from someone standing outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.260
They say the car, which isn't approved to drive&nbsp;
on roads, has seven wheels and is powered by a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:48.660
scooter engine and then it can reach up to 25&nbsp;
miles per hour on straight and smooth roads.

